  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7fc2bae267f24a4425cb71321e1f0202f937b62dad17ad934d46b6ab23da25c1",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d1f0f5a1d3dd0ab5116cefd36a25a071e5b982f54274790317c8efe3d321b13f",
      "text": "悟空的\n游泳课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b4fda521fa359124adbc1e066dbedcb1330fde6187c5624a5093d22a7920752",
      "text": "敖丙在教练身边游。\n悟空看得眼睛亮亮的：\n“我也想学！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cf440ce82996bc91f2f44b047e168715106f973275caccf6a0b101d7c35ffee3",
      "text": "可一走到池边，\n悟空又缩回了脚趾。\n“我有点怕。”\n“没关系，咱们慢慢来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "81abc4d20351d469b9697915a01f003e46405c4a8c6a62161b2b01ea7df342a6",
      "text": "沙僧在池边陪着。\n教练伸出手：\n“准备好了吗？”\n悟空点点头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7902aec6c19fedfcdfa6f36adb8a5808d15c0f1d6046a8954505baaedf285723",
      "text": "悟空扶好池边。\n教练就站在他身旁。\n敖丙轻轻拍了拍水——哗！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54f08d98d975f514c491cea4db15776412b312ae96221c9a0222edf212c0ce37",
      "text": "三只小玩具，浮呀浮。\n小鲨鱼、海星，还有小丑鱼！\n“你们也来上课呀？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7bd7f708010925b0c745325cef1461d37511122eed20a917de4d67978bf38b2a",
      "text": "教练拿来一个泡沫哑铃。\n两头蓝蓝的，又大又轻。\n悟空乐了：\n“小鱼也要练力气吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54b48ac956f342a5a47eb96fe789783cf865b42ee3311045097d9e3d48d88b32",
      "text": "“这是帮咱们练习的。”\n悟空笑了，\n手还稳稳扶着池边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dbe336826e1ed6e2905aa33809ddfb6413521667369678321fb429d866551a19",
      "text": "教练把嘴轻轻贴近水面。\n咕噜，咕噜——\n悟空也吹出了小泡泡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47be18cadefbe3a9248d1047d08bb2dc450f6017f2a1a451e7bcbc59d268ffa9",
      "text": "水花碰到了下巴。\n悟空抬起脸，眨眨眼。\n“歇一会儿吧。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "06ee96df5ecc316e35f480717dd50ee2be98df461e1d178c007c0a2a4bc7d996",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n悟空扶好池边：\n“我的小泡泡又回来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea6e9a1f9b7c71352fb48df7f5c228dd7e58d4581a6480e05ca573a323bad35b",
      "text": "“教练，扶着我漂一会儿吧。”\n“好，我扶着呢。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "52934f5cb7fd8249aad838cb863de63c77deff77acb5168b10ec38ca49e0a1ce",
      "text": "教练托着悟空，他慢慢漂起来。\n小肚皮像一只小船。\n“还是一只带尾巴的小船！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f4c8e560cef853b3ded5e23bea6f81c94219be03908e38fa7ca32563715866d",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n这回练习踢腿。\n“腿伸长，膝盖放松。”\n悟空把腿向后伸长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce9e292c7c47f695df1b17580ae8299e7d7829aff7c20042a91c4e382fb6e9f5",
      "text": "“膝盖放松，轻轻踢。”\n水花变小啦。\n敖丙笑着说：\n“小鲨鱼也在看你呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "edb874d7c42dc08dcc86877e80bb7c320b27203a8911f0e3cf73e561ba4d3339",
      "text": "悟空握好泡沫哑铃。\n“头朝下，看水里。”\n他低头吹着泡泡，轻轻踢腿。\n教练一直扶着他。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2190803406f6875c21ca848aa730eb50617a5731bf9fe76afb21a85369125fd3",
      "text": "又练了几次，\n悟空想试试不用哑铃。\n“教练，你就在我身边吗？”\n“就在你身旁。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27d7073e60d390654d000b1dee87a43f5acb9097bd9ae6b09501d9b309a2bedd",
      "text": "悟空向前游了一小段。\n教练就跟在旁边。\n悟空转向池边，伸手扶稳。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a672cabae25fd31b6f07713188479cd264b7c255c5ab2ef0b41e8a4f2bf9153b",
      "text": "“我游了一小段！”\n“我看见啦！”敖丙笑着说。\n下课了，教练扶悟空上台阶。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c09ce32f461511a344b32a45329217535bcc5422f89e743a093f023a0711d37",
      "text": "三只小玩具，都回篮子啦。\n“晚安，小鲨鱼。”\n“今天你也忙坏啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
